WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:05.635
Every day starts the same way:
open all your apps and websites,

2
00:00:05.685 --> 00:00:08.085
then drag each one to the right screen.

3
00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.940
Castra does it for you — in one click.

4
00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:18.724
Castra is a workspace
launcher for Windows.

5
00:00:19.245 --> 00:00:22.045
Each workspace is one window — an app,

6
00:00:22.095 --> 00:00:24.570
a website or a command —
with its own display,

7
00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:26.136
position and size.

8
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:30.311
Group them into profiles, and
launch a whole setup at once.

9
00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:33.665
Setting it up takes three steps: add,

10
00:00:33.715 --> 00:00:34.911
place, launch.

11
00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:40.378
Click Add workspace and
choose what to open:

12
00:00:40.428 --> 00:00:43.278
an application, a website, or a command,

13
00:00:43.328 --> 00:00:45.215
just like the Windows Run box.

14
00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.675
Pick the display, paste the address,

15
00:00:47.725 --> 00:00:48.938
and it's in the list.

16
00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:53.163
Already have your windows arranged?

17
00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:58.365
Choose Open windows, and Castra turns
what's on screen into workspaces.

18
00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:04.424
To fine-tune the spot,
click the layout icon.

19
00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:07.990
Drag and resize the frame
right on your display —

20
00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.870
or type the position
and size to the pixel.

21
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.069
Double-click a workspace to tune it:

22
00:01:15.162 --> 00:01:20.207
its own volume, its own zoom, or app
mode without the browser toolbar.

23
00:01:20.735 --> 00:01:25.322
Auto sign-in presses Sign in once your
browser fills in the saved password —

24
00:01:25.372 --> 00:01:26.954
Castra never reads it.

25
00:01:28.895 --> 00:01:32.008
Run apps as administrator
after a single prompt,

26
00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:35.945
start them in the background, or let a
click sequence open the right tab for

27
00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:36.612
you.

28
00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:42.755
Press play to open one workspace, or
Launch all to open the whole profile —

29
00:01:42.805 --> 00:01:45.240
one by one, each in its place.

30
00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:50.777
App already running?
Castra opens a new copy,

31
00:01:50.827 --> 00:01:53.028
moves the window into place, or skips it —

32
00:01:53.078 --> 00:01:53.984
your call.

33
00:01:55.150 --> 00:01:58.879
Display unplugged? Its windows
open on your main screen.

34
00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:05.550
Moved things around? Put back
returns every window to its place.

35
00:02:06.095 --> 00:02:09.074
Close all closes every
window in the profile.

36
00:02:10.605 --> 00:02:14.043
And Clear cache hard-refreshes
stuck dashboards under a cover,

37
00:02:14.093 --> 00:02:15.633
so nothing flickers.

38
00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:19.990
Profiles keep a setup for every occasion —

39
00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:22.584
match day, a showcase, or home.

40
00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:26.688
The display map shows
every window to scale:

41
00:02:26.738 --> 00:02:30.100
click a display to filter,
right-click to recolor it,

42
00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.733
and hover a chip to
light up the real screen.

43
00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:38.897
Prefer the keyboard? Press Control
K and type to launch a workspace,

44
00:02:38.947 --> 00:02:41.599
switch profiles, or run any command.

45
00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:46.707
For websites, add the
browser extension for Chrome,

46
00:02:46.757 --> 00:02:48.125
Edge or Brave.

47
00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:52.705
It powers per-tab volume, zoom
that sticks after a restart,

48
00:02:52.755 --> 00:02:57.358
and auto sign-in — plus a mixer
for every tab that's playing sound.

49
00:02:59.465 --> 00:03:03.902
In Settings, start Castra with Windows
and launch a profile the moment you sign

50
00:03:03.952 --> 00:03:04.521
in.

51
00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:09.464
Export your profiles as a backup, or
share your setup with a colleague.

52
00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:15.620
Something off? The bug button sends
a report straight to the developer.

53
00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:20.835
Castra. One click — every
window in its place.
